{"3600170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escape the Scam Compound", "steam_appid": 3600170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently <strong>in development</strong>. If you're interested, <strong>wishlist</strong> and <strong>follow</strong> for <strong>Steam email notifications</strong> at launch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/55df30604da8fa481928036210852f6b.poster.avif?t=1782952118\" width=512 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/55df30604da8fa481928036210852f6b.webm?t=1782952118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/55df30604da8fa481928036210852f6b.mp4?t=1782952118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruitment Warning</strong>: A fake high-paying job lures you far from home and traps you inside a scam compound.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lured far from home by a fake high-paying job, you lose your documents, your freedom, and your way out. Trapped in a sealed scam compound under constant surveillance, you must stay calm, work with fellow victims, search for clues, plan routes, solve mechanical puzzles, and escape alive if possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/c4961d8e649c69f0032b9378cf421921.avif?t=1782952118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/c4961d8e649c69f0032b9378cf421921.webp?t=1782952118 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Premise: As scam compounds are brought down, you are lured into one and must escape with fellow victims.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As cross-border crackdowns intensify, remaining scam compounds are forced into lockdown and relocation. Lured inside, you and fellow victims must solve puzzles, plan routes, gather evidence, and escape—or work together to bring the operation down from within as patrols tighten and clues grow harder to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/419997ca2f2bdf7ed5f2dde3d4c94397.avif?t=1782952118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/419997ca2f2bdf7ed5f2dde3d4c94397.webp?t=1782952118 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Co-op: </strong>Supports 1–4 players. Play solo or team up with others.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a victim lured by a fake job offer into a sealed scam compound, where survival depends on teamwork. Shared intel, co-op puzzles, clue gathering, mutual rescue, and tool coordination drive every escape, with anti-fraud themes woven throughout. Every clue brings you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/88e858133a5d2ca51cc5517908556800.avif?t=1782952118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/88e858133a5d2ca51cc5517908556800.webp?t=1782952118 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle Progress: Piece together clues from details, forge your way out through teamwork, and reveal the truth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside a sealed scam compound under constant surveillance, the truth and escape hide in overlooked details and crucial deductions. Work with companions to preserve evidence, evade cameras and patrols, solve puzzles, unlock doors and mechanisms, choose side paths, and break through to safety together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/b1c4217d807916e38137c12745faba35.avif?t=1782952118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/b1c4217d807916e38137c12745faba35.webp?t=1782952118 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Semi-Open World:</strong> Plan your route through a watched compound, turning each move into a chance to survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-Open World: Explore a vast, danger-filled compound where survival depends on sharp observation and careful planning. Face patrols and surveillance, unlock shortcuts and hiding spots, map escape routes, master the layout, and turn every decision into your team’s next chance at freedom together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/ee900b122f7d7be2c295bd4fd699719f.avif?t=1782952118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/ee900b122f7d7be2c295bd4fd699719f.webp?t=1782952118 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Patrol System:</strong> Different facility zones across the compound are guarded by different patrol leaders.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrols cover the compound, and routines can shift without warning. Survival depends on observation and anticipation. Guards, security staff, female dealers, underground clinic doctors, canteen cooks, and supervisors move unpredictably, so coordinate with companions and plan escape routes together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/27af3d1dbe15f67ab44aa047850e7acf.avif?t=1782952118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/27af3d1dbe15f67ab44aa047850e7acf.webp?t=1782952118 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Distress Call:</strong> After escape, night falls and you are stranded in the wild. Reach help and send an SOS fast.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape is not the end. Beyond the compound lies a wilderness just as dangerous. Dynamic weather brings night rain, dense fog, and low visibility. Track emergency beacons, send an SOS, and hold out for rescue. In the final stretch, calm thinking and teamwork are your last path to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/347c8a1eba3913acca047bcb7ee5393b.avif?t=1782952118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/347c8a1eba3913acca047bcb7ee5393b.webp?t=1782952118 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Anti-Fraud &amp; Multiple Endings: Beyond fighting to escape with fellow victims, you can also pursue anti-fraud outcomes by taking on side missions together and shaping how the story ends.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape is not your only choice. Beyond surviving together, you and your companions can go further: destroy servers, cut power, rescue victims, preserve clues, gather evidence, send it to the police, and shape an ending where the compound is not forgotten, but brought down in the name of justice now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/0e829c221d1a07ac4746f70809feb63c.avif?t=1782952118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/0e829c221d1a07ac4746f70809feb63c.webp?t=1782952118 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently <strong>in development</strong>. If you're interested, <strong>wishlist</strong> and <strong>follow</strong> for <strong>Steam email notifications</strong> at launch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/55df30604da8fa481928036210852f6b.poster.avif?t=1782952118\" width=512 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/55df30604da8fa481928036210852f6b.webm?t=1782952118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/55df30604da8fa481928036210852f6b.mp4?t=1782952118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruitment Warning</strong>: A fake high-paying job lures you far from home and traps you inside a scam compound.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lured far from home by a fake high-paying job, you lose your documents, your freedom, and your way out. Trapped in a sealed scam compound under constant surveillance, you must stay calm, work with fellow victims, search for clues, plan routes, solve mechanical puzzles, and escape alive if possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/c4961d8e649c69f0032b9378cf421921.avif?t=1782952118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/c4961d8e649c69f0032b9378cf421921.webp?t=1782952118 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Premise: As scam compounds are brought down, you are lured into one and must escape with fellow victims.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As cross-border crackdowns intensify, remaining scam compounds are forced into lockdown and relocation. Lured inside, you and fellow victims must solve puzzles, plan routes, gather evidence, and escape—or work together to bring the operation down from within as patrols tighten and clues grow harder to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/419997ca2f2bdf7ed5f2dde3d4c94397.avif?t=1782952118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/419997ca2f2bdf7ed5f2dde3d4c94397.webp?t=1782952118 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Co-op: </strong>Supports 1–4 players. Play solo or team up with others.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a victim lured by a fake job offer into a sealed scam compound, where survival depends on teamwork. Shared intel, co-op puzzles, clue gathering, mutual rescue, and tool coordination drive every escape, with anti-fraud themes woven throughout. Every clue brings you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/88e858133a5d2ca51cc5517908556800.avif?t=1782952118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/88e858133a5d2ca51cc5517908556800.webp?t=1782952118 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle Progress: Piece together clues from details, forge your way out through teamwork, and reveal the truth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside a sealed scam compound under constant surveillance, the truth and escape hide in overlooked details and crucial deductions. Work with companions to preserve evidence, evade cameras and patrols, solve puzzles, unlock doors and mechanisms, choose side paths, and break through to safety together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/b1c4217d807916e38137c12745faba35.avif?t=1782952118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/b1c4217d807916e38137c12745faba35.webp?t=1782952118 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Semi-Open World:</strong> Plan your route through a watched compound, turning each move into a chance to survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-Open World: Explore a vast, danger-filled compound where survival depends on sharp observation and careful planning. Face patrols and surveillance, unlock shortcuts and hiding spots, map escape routes, master the layout, and turn every decision into your team’s next chance at freedom together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/ee900b122f7d7be2c295bd4fd699719f.avif?t=1782952118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/ee900b122f7d7be2c295bd4fd699719f.webp?t=1782952118 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Patrol System:</strong> Different facility zones across the compound are guarded by different patrol leaders.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrols cover the compound, and routines can shift without warning. Survival depends on observation and anticipation. Guards, security staff, female dealers, underground clinic doctors, canteen cooks, and supervisors move unpredictably, so coordinate with companions and plan escape routes together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/